Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: InstaChat <instachat@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/AayushKumar1028/Insta-chat
Description: Chat-only Instagram desktop client
 Direct messages without Reels, Explore, Feed or Stories.
 .
 InstaChat embeds Instagram's web client (WebKitGTK) and enforces a
 Direct-Messages-only allowlist at two levels: a native navigation guard that
 blocks every non-DM page, and an in-page SPA guard that force-returns the
 app to the DM inbox if the client-side router ever leaves the chat
 experience. Voice and video calls work through Instagram's WebRTC client.